Do not import firmware db certificates as boot-manifest trust anchors.
EFI Secure Boot must remain enabled. Supply explicit public X.509 certificates
through TRUST_ANCHORS; they are embedded in the loader. Firmware certificate
and digest revocations still apply. An enforcing loader with no usable compiled
anchors refuses to boot. This separates manifest trust from firmware executable
trust; it does not provide generation rollback policy or prevent selection of
another firmware-trusted loader. Rebuild the loader and its libraries when
changing this option or its trust inputs.
